			"Message": "build(deps): bump pnpm/action-setup from 6.0.1 to 6.0.3\n\nBumps [pnpm/action-setup](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup) from 6.0.1 to 6.0.3.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup/releases)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/pnpm/action-setup/compare/v6.0.1...v6.0.3)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: pnpm/action-setup\n  dependency-version: 6.0.3\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
			"SHA": "66c6c4f303d4885c4da58386c5c03a316b783f6f"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-22T00:40:06Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				632,
				2
			],
			"Message": "perf(Cocoon): Add Wave 7 instrumentation to $deltaExtensions handler\n\nAdd comprehensive observability to the delta extensions handler for regression hunting:\n- Log added/removed counts, total registry size, activation events added, and wall-clock duration per delta operation\n- Extract reusable `IdentifierOf` helper for consistent extension identifier extraction\n- Emit extended `deltaExtensions` event with registrySize and durationMs fields\n- Return durationMs in the handler response for Mountain-side observability\n\nAlso fix ISerializationResult and IDeserializationResult interfaces to use explicit `Error: string | undefined` instead of `Error?: string`. This prevents TypeScript's `exactOptionalPropertyTypes` from rejecting `undefined` assignment to optional fields without explicit `| undefined` in the type declaration.\n\nThese metrics make sudden registry growth or deletion visible during VSIX install/uninstall workflows (K2/K3 → K4).",
			"SHA": "1b837e484d73a7e7e9310eb5d30402500f4626af"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-22T00:19:23Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				632,
				7
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Split monolithic Window service into modular sub-modules\n\nContinue reorganizing the Cocoon extension host's Window service from a monolithic file into smaller, focused modules within the Window/ directory:\n\n- Split Window.ts implementation into: TextDocument.ts (ShowTextDocument, message dialogs), QuickInput.ts (ShowQuickPick, ShowInputBox), FileDialogs.ts (ShowOpenDialog, ShowSaveDialog), StatusBar.ts, OutputChannel.ts, WebviewPanel.ts, and Progress.ts\n- Add Window/Index.ts as the service composition point wiring all sub-modules together\n- Keep Window.ts as a re-export shim for backward compatibility with existing import paths\n- Add ModuleInterceptor/Index.ts barrel re-export with types separated in Types.ts\n\nThis follows the same modularization pattern as the previous Message and WorkspaceNamespace refactoring, improving maintainability and enabling independent evolution of each window operation subsystem while preserving the existing API surface.",
			"SHA": "7955b036327c85d73ad23fdc81ed7751f591eb20"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-22T00:09:53Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				627,
				26
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Split monolithic Message and WorkspaceNamespace into modular directories\n\nReorganize the Cocoon extension host's IPC messaging and workspace namespace implementations from large monolithic files into smaller, focused modules within dedicated directories.\n\n- Split Source/IPC/Message.ts into Message/ directory with separate modules for Types, Constants, VSBuffer, Validation, Serialization, Deserialization, Batching, and Utilities\n- Split Source/Services/Handler/VscodeAPI/WorkspaceNamespace.ts into WorkspaceNamespace/ directory with Configuration, FileSystemNamespace, FileSystemWatcher, FindFiles, Helpers, Providers, and TextDocument modules\n- Add new Window service modules (FileDialogs, Interfaces, OutputChannel, QuickInput, StatusBar) and ModuleInterceptor/Types\n- Maintain backward compatibility via barrel re-export files (Index.ts) so existing import paths continue to work\n\nThis refactoring improves maintainability and enables independent evolution of each subsystem.",
			"SHA": "91b490069b9039783ce7fde9058e749e1113b7e4"
		}
	],
